        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2252_8537.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Mein freündtlich grueß zuvor, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nebstaenerbiethung</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>meiner geflißnen diensten, Ehrnvester, sonders
<lb n="3"/>guenstiger Herr unndt freündt, Ihme solle Ich
<lb n="4"/>hiemit ohnverhalten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waßmaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neulicher</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>tagen, von E. Ehrsamen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Rath der Statt Sanct
<lb n="6"/>Gallen</orgName>, mir Ampts wegen zuegeschriben, auch zu
<lb n="7"/>gleich angedeueth worden, wie das vor etlichen
<lb n="8"/>Monaten, Ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mitbuerger</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Caspar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Reiner</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="9"/>mit hinderlaßung einer zimblichen Nahrung, ohne
<lb n="10"/>Leibs Erben, todts verfahren, Dannenhero Ehrnged.
<lb n="11"/>Rath. von mir gewiße Oberkheitliche nach-
<lb n="12"/>richtung, und besigelten Schein, Ob, und welcher
<lb n="13"/>gestalten, deß zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-424" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Ögersheim</placeName>, vor lengst, ab-
<lb n="14"/>gelebten Schultheißen <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Phlierers</persName>
<lb n="15"/>respectivè <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kinder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Enckhel</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstorbnen</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Casparo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Reiners</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwanth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewesen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begerth</unclear>.
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> Ich dann albereith 2. Stäm, der eine
<lb n="18"/>zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-375" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Franckhenthal</placeName>, und der andre zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-424" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Ogersheim</placeName>,
<lb n="19"/>auch zuegleich dießen, in erfahrung gebracht, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>.
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herr</unclear> auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbschafft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegelaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">könthe</unclear>, wo er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nur</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehevördest</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seine</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwanthschafft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnuegsam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Liquidieren</unclear>, unndt
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erweißen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thäethe</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hab</unclear> Ich durch Zeigern,
<lb n="24"/>eignen Botten, ein solches <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihme</unclear> notificieren,
<lb n="25"/>unndt weil die obgd beijde Stäm, arme uner-
<lb n="26"/>zogene Pupillen, auch beij den andern angemaßten
<lb n="27"/>Zue unndt Erben, zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St: Gallen</placeName> albereit etliche
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2252_8538.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">difficulteten</unclear>, wider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hießige</unclear> erben in gemein
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erzeigen</unclear> wollen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bin</unclear> ich bedacht in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eigner</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">person</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">raiß</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verrichten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> solche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwor</unclear>-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bene</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ausfündig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zumachen</unclear>, zu
<lb n="32"/>welchen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">endt</unclear> der Herr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entweders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbst</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> zu mir
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nacher</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Newstatt</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verfuegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwandt</unclear>-
<lb n="34"/>schafft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">justificieren</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unndt</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">raiß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> mit
<lb n="35"/>mir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">underreden</unclear> wolle, ob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemblich</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbst</unclear> mit
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abzuraißen</unclear>, oder aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">völligen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewaldt</unclear> mit
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zugeben</unclear>, bedacht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seye</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> zwischen will ich die
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nottürfftige</unclear> documenten, bey der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">statt</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-375" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Franckenthal</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ogersheim</unclear></placeName> bestellen,
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolte</unclear> ich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewißer</unclear> nachrichtung
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohverhalten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Goettlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear>-
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wahrung</unclear> hiemit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerseits</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnbefohlen</unclear>.
<lb n="43"/>Datum <origPlace resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Newstatt</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hardt</unclear></origPlace>. <origDate when="1621" resp="#ner">den
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">2</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">9bris</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ao</unclear> 1621.</origDate>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Deß</unclear> Herrn
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dienstwilliger</unclear>.
<lb n="47"/>Dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrenvesten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgeachten</unclear>,
<lb n="48"/><persName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Preißern</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Tuchscherrer</unclear> zu
<lb n="49"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kubala</unclear></placeName>, Meinem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear>
<lb n="50"/>Herrn und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Freundt</unclear>.
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuester</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pfaltz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Aufsauth</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ambts</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Newstatt</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="53"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Johann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Beyer</unclear></persName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2252_8539.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2252_8540.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="54"/><persName resp="#ner">Hanß Kueler</persName> Wuertten-
<lb n="55"/>berger.
</p>
